commit cc115c5cc05b628de469fa0b8b7ad89c984a7ec7
Author: whycz <whyczz@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 13 21:59:10 2026 -0500

    feat(q): bp3 q hooks emitter and hooks.json delivery
    
    Muse hook payloads on stdin become past-tense event lines (run_started, run_settled, run_unsettled, usage_recorded, refused, lint_checked) in the exp ledger through an internal fact writer. Fail-open: exit 0, no writes for garbage, foreign repos, unbound sessions, or reentrant calls. Binding is witnessed from the env preset in PreToolUse commands; the registry lives in the git dir so witnessing never dirties the tree. Event lines carry no edge/from/to keys, so the fold skips them. bp3 skills install delivers .claude/hooks.json; test/hooks.sh covers every Exp 6 acceptance case and make check is green.

